flowchart LR
    subgraph AKS["AKS cluster"]
        direction LR
        subgraph KS["kube-system · AKS add-ons"]
            direction TB
            WI["Workload Identity<br/>webhook"]
            CSI["Secrets Store CSI driver<br/>+ Azure Key Vault provider"]
        end

        subgraph NS["namespace default"]
            direction TB
            SA["ServiceAccount travel-agent-backend<br/>annotation: workload identity client-id"]
            POD["Pod travel-agent-backend<br/>label azure.workload.identity/use"]
            SEC["Secret travel-agent-secrets<br/>(synced, not in the chart)"]
            SPC["SecretProviderClass<br/>travel-agent-secrets-spc<br/>object: google-api-key"]
        end
    end

    subgraph AZ["Azure"]
        direction LR
        ENTRA["Entra ID<br/>federated credential<br/>trusts this cluster's OIDC issuer"]
        KV["Key Vault<br/>google-api-key<br/>role: Key Vault Secrets User"]
    end

    SA -.->|identity of| POD
    WI -->|"① injects a projected<br/>service-account token"| POD
    CSI -.->|reads its config| SPC
    POD -->|"② mounts volume<br/>secrets-store-inline"| CSI
    CSI -->|"③ exchanges the pod's token"| ENTRA
    ENTRA -->|"④ access token lets the driver<br/>read google-api-key"| KV
    CSI -->|"⑤ syncs"| SEC
    SEC -->|"⑥ env GOOGLE_API_KEY<br/>(read once, at container start)"| POD
